People seem to be interested in better hand to hand combat in nethack.
Suggestions have included training in certain places and new classes of
characters. These seem a little less nethackish in my view. Perhaps a hand to
hand combat skill could be gained. Here is how it would work. If you fought
monsters for a long time with no weapon, you might gain an ability to attack
better. 
"You give the kobold a karate chop! It reels from the damage."

You might just have it one day as an intrinsic of lethal hands. 
Or perhaps your probability of doing it would go up the more you fought with no
weapon. Perhaps your god would smile down on you beating monsters off with your
bare hands...
"You feel lethal."

These chops might be much less effective on dragons etc etc.

